### Abrir conta
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId": "ACC-1", "owner": "Diego"}

### Depositar
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC-1/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 1000}

### Sacar
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC-1/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 300}

### Encerrar
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC-1/close

### Resumo (read model)
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC-1

### Resumo exigindo versao minima (read-your-writes)
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC-1?minVersion=3

### Extrato (read model)
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC-1/statement

### Historico de eventos (event store)
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC-1/events

### Ranking por saldo
GET http://localhost:8080/rankings/balance?limit=5

### Estado das projecoes (checkpoint e lag)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/projections

### Rebuild de uma projecao (apaga read model e reprocessa o historico)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/projections/statement/rebuild

### Transferencia (saga)
POST http://localhost:8080/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"transferId": "TR-1", "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1", "targetAccountId": "ACC-2", "amount": 100}

### Status da transferencia (read model)
GET http://localhost:8080/transfers/TR-1

### Eventos da conta de origem (ver TransferDebited / TransferDebitReversed)
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC-1/events

### Pausar a saga (para ver o timeout acontecer)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/projections/transfer-saga/pause

### Retomar a saga
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/projections/transfer-saga/resume
